+/**
+ * Extension point that lets a dynamic plugin take over the body of the pod
+ * "Terminal" tab with a different transport (e.g. VNC over port-forward) for
+ * containers it claims. Console core stays transport-agnostic: it only renders
+ * the extra "via" dropdown and delegates rendering to the extension.
